{"version":1,"content":"<p>經歷此前一輪持續上漲後，近期華強北顯卡市場行情出現明顯反轉，RTX 50系列顯卡價格開始大幅回落，部分型號短時間內出現數千元的降幅。據央視財經報道，此前受海外停產傳聞刺激，RTX 50系列顯卡價格連續上漲11個交易日。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585456.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.655911+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T08:10:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"0a34b669e82ad2b23f0b6159a060a798b284c67005c58f3f2dc1829805b2dea9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}